possible, as strong as possible, as accomplished as possible. And if you doubt that people will try this, just take a look at profiles that people post on online dating. Those profiles are always trumpeting one's virtues. They never mention one's shortcomings. They never mention the things that make one a unique human being. And the reason that I say that these strategies are counterproductive is that they may well help you feel admired. It may well make other people think, wow, that person is really impressive. But that's not what feeling loved is about.

